1
00:01:37,530 --> 00:01:42,900
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,890
[Episode 12]

3
00:01:46,430 --> 00:01:48,000
I apologize to everyone.

4
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,600
I won't disturb you anymore.

5
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,560
Qingyuan!

6
00:01:54,430 --> 00:01:56,000
Chunzhi, listen to me.

7
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,509
I've heard enough from you!

8
00:01:57,509 --> 00:01:58,310
Chunzhi!

9
00:01:58,310 --> 00:01:59,560
You give her your whole heart,

10
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,000
but you don't even know
she's leading you on

11
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,000
while fooling around with Yan Rui
behind your back!

12
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,070
Stop making a scene.

13
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:05,000
I'm not!

14
00:02:06,950 --> 00:02:08,080
Chunzhi,

15
00:02:08,630 --> 00:02:09,520
do you know

16
00:02:09,810 --> 00:02:12,610
Grandmother has already
betrothed her to Yan Rui?

17
00:02:14,150 --> 00:02:15,360
Utter nonsense!

18
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,640
This is unseemly!

19
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,800
Mother...

20
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,000
Qingyuan!

21
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:30,440
Qingyuan.

22
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,630
What Qingru just said,

23
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:36,890
don't take it to heart.

24
00:02:36,910 --> 00:02:37,960
She's always been

25
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,020
spoiled like that.

26
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,270
I'll find a time to have a serious

27
00:02:41,270 --> 00:02:42,070
word with her.

28
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,000
You saw the spectacle

29
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:47,170
that unfolded just now.

30
00:02:47,470 --> 00:02:49,800
I'm seen as the black sheep
of the Xie family.

31
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,930
If you're looking to get married,

32
00:02:52,030 --> 00:02:54,030
you should choose someone fitting.

33
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,160
I don't care what others say.

34
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,460
My previous rash proposal

35
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,400
was forced by the situation.

36
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:03,640
But instead of evading it,

37
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,810
you treated me with sincerity.

38
00:03:06,190 --> 00:03:07,150
That made me

39
00:03:07,470 --> 00:03:08,730
respect you even more.

40
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,000
You're really

41
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:16,960
good at comforting people.

42
00:03:17,070 --> 00:03:18,329
I feel much better now.

43
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,430
I just wonder

44
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:26,800
which lucky gentleman will

45
00:03:27,150 --> 00:03:28,190
get to marry you.

46
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:35,230
There are things I have to do.

47
00:03:35,750 --> 00:03:37,240
When I'm done with them,

48
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:39,630
I'll leave marriage to fate.

49
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:42,870
Does that mean...

50
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,530
there's no one in your heart right now?

51
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:50,030
I'm not looking for love.

52
00:03:51,750 --> 00:03:52,950
But there's one thing

53
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:54,470
I need your help with.

54
00:03:57,150 --> 00:03:58,079
Sure. What is it?

55
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,760
I want to see the marquis.

56
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:01,710
My father?

57
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:05,040
I know he rarely sees outsiders,

58
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,890
but I have an urgent matter.

59
00:04:07,630 --> 00:04:09,910
I can't tell you why right now,

60
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,530
but I promise
I'll explain everything later.

61
00:04:16,870 --> 00:04:17,510
Okay.

62
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:19,589
I will make it happen.

63
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,870
Thank you.

64
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,920
Are you out of your mind?

65
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,260
You must be possessed,

66
00:04:30,390 --> 00:04:32,270
acting crazy in front of
the marquis's son!

67
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:33,800
Is this how I raised you?

68
00:04:35,390 --> 00:04:36,430
Qingyuan has

69
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,170
long belonged to Yan Rui,

70
00:04:39,830 --> 00:04:41,590
yet she still goes out of her way

71
00:04:41,610 --> 00:04:43,670
to seduce my Chunzhi.

72
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:47,420
I was worried Chunzhi would be fooled.

73
00:04:47,450 --> 00:04:49,350
That's why I told him.

74
00:04:50,430 --> 00:04:52,890
She's the one
who did those shameful things.

75
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:53,720
Mother,

76
00:04:54,070 --> 00:04:56,080
why are you scolding me?

77
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:57,450
How dare you talk back!

78
00:04:57,830 --> 00:04:58,680
Mother,

79
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,160
stop scolding Second Sister.

80
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:03,040
She didn't do anything wrong.

81
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:03,920
Shut up.

82
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,310
If I don't

83
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,600
discipline you properly today,

84
00:05:09,630 --> 00:05:10,270
who knows

85
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:12,920
what kind of trouble
you might cause down the line?

86
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:13,750
Nanny Liu.

87
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:15,370
Punish her with

88
00:05:15,430 --> 00:05:16,630
20 lashes of the cane!

89
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:17,310
Mother!

90
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:17,920
Yes.

91
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:21,830
Hit her!

92
00:05:22,510 --> 00:05:23,750
Go on!

93
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:26,160
Mother, just beat me to death!

94
00:05:26,510 --> 00:05:27,800
Hit me!

95
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,390
These can go on the shelves.

96
00:05:49,390 --> 00:05:49,870
Okay.

97
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:07,050
It's rare to see you so lost in thought.

98
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,800
Are you thinking of

99
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:10,600
Young Master Li or Lord Yan?

100
00:06:11,830 --> 00:06:13,580
Of course I'm thinking of...

101
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:16,520
you, Eldest Sister.

102
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,480
Do you think marriage is

103
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:21,660
some kind of joke?

104
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:25,200
Right now, be it
Young Master Li or Lord Yan,

105
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,640
you have to make a choice.

106
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,480
Young Master Li
comes from a prominent family

107
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,810
and has a pure heart.

108
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:32,610
He won't marry anyone but you.

109
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,400
What's holding you back?

110
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:38,490
He and I are on different paths.

111
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:41,070
What about Lord Yan?

112
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,450
Are you on the same path?

113
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,930
Yan Rui is an old fox.

114
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,720
I can't figure him out at all.

115
00:06:49,310 --> 00:06:51,450
You got involved with Lord Yan

116
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,730
because of that estate incident.

117
00:06:53,750 --> 00:06:55,280
Grandmother had no choice.

118
00:06:55,390 --> 00:06:56,740
Now that Father's back,

119
00:06:56,870 --> 00:06:59,130
you should pull out to protect yourself.

120
00:06:59,310 --> 00:07:00,560
He's been driving up grain prices

121
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:02,720
and swindling army provisions
throughout Hengtang.

122
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:04,920
He'll run into trouble sooner or later.

123
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:08,470
I'll get back to work.

124
00:07:14,270 --> 00:07:15,480
The porridge is so watery.

125
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,510
How can we eat it?

126
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,950
You pervert the law!

127
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,220
Corrupt official!

128
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,680
How dare you, you unruly pleb!

129
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,510
Arrest him!

130
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:24,240
What are you doing?

131
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:24,870
Let me go!

132
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,190
Corrupt official!

133
00:07:26,190 --> 00:07:26,950
Let me go!

134
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,420
Corrupt official!

135
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:30,230
Please don't be mad, My Lord.

136
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,510
Let me go!

137
00:07:34,190 --> 00:07:34,920
My Lord,

138
00:07:35,740 --> 00:07:37,200
to be honest,

139
00:07:37,750 --> 00:07:39,150
these displaced victims

140
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:42,450
survive on this little relief grain
day after day.

141
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,720
They're at their breaking point.

142
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:47,830
The county office is also
running out of grain.

143
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:52,720
I didn't expect there to be
so many disaster victims.

144
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,450
Yes, indeed.

145
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,300
No doubt, the grain is insufficient.

146
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,010
We need to collect more.

147
00:07:59,270 --> 00:07:59,870
My Lord,

148
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:02,150
if we collect more,

149
00:08:02,430 --> 00:08:04,920
the grain price will likely go up again.

150
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:07,190
It's even better if it goes up.

151
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:10,240
Hengtang's been hit so hard
by this disaster;

152
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,950
the relief grain is nowhere near enough.

153
00:08:11,950 --> 00:08:13,630
We'll have to collect sooner or later.

154
00:08:13,630 --> 00:08:15,270
Think about it, Lord Wei.

155
00:08:15,420 --> 00:08:17,610
As long as we have the grain,

156
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,360
the higher the price,

157
00:08:19,750 --> 00:08:22,350
the higher we can sell it
to the imperial court.

158
00:08:22,750 --> 00:08:24,240
Both inside and out,

159
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:27,300
there's a lot of money to be made here.

160
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:33,120
You're absolutely right, My Lord.

161
00:08:33,870 --> 00:08:35,990
But there is one thing I don't get.

162
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:39,830
Where should we get the money
for collecting grain?

163
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:41,000
The imperial court.

164
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:44,030
The relief silver allocated by the court
is on the way.

165
00:08:44,030 --> 00:08:45,870
When the time comes,
we'll split the grain

166
00:08:45,870 --> 00:08:47,200
and the money equally.

167
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,880
The grain is in our hands,

168
00:08:49,150 --> 00:08:51,840
and so is the money.

169
00:08:59,830 --> 00:09:01,870
Please forgive my slow brain.

170
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:04,750
That's why you've been checking
the army provisions everywhere

171
00:09:04,750 --> 00:09:06,930
since you arrived in Hengtang.

172
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,280
Your Lordship

173
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:10,440
is truly a brilliant strategist

174
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:12,270
with great foresight.

175
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:14,200
So, Lord Wei,

176
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:16,550
please pay extra attention

177
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:18,440
to the relief grain.

178
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,200
It's an honor to share your burdens.

179
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,600
I'd gladly lay down my life
for you, My Lord!

180
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:23,720
Good.

181
00:09:24,790 --> 00:09:25,390
By the way,

182
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:28,400
I've decided that the grain collection

183
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,930
will be on the eighth of next month.

184
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,080
Noted.

185
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:34,210
Take care, My Lord.

186
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:56,030
That's a risky move you're making.

187
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,720
Holding out
until the supplies come is easy.

188
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,270
The hard part is keeping control

189
00:10:04,270 --> 00:10:07,000
and dealing with
their inevitable retaliation.

190
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,270
It is risky.

191
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:12,260
So we must have enough troops

192
00:10:12,390 --> 00:10:14,320
to ensure that nothing goes wrong.

193
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,900
Where will you get the troops?

194
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,960
You mean,

195
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:30,330
after the case was concluded,

196
00:10:30,910 --> 00:10:33,240
Yan Rui hasn't made any moves?

197
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,460
That's right, My Lord.

198
00:10:35,670 --> 00:10:36,800
Please have a look at

199
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,750
this bowl of Purple Bamboo Shoot Tea
I've whisked.

200
00:10:40,750 --> 00:10:43,150
Isn't it vibrant and aromatic?

201
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:48,630
No wonder the Tea Sage, Lu Yu, called it

202
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:50,160
the crown jewel of all teas.

203
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,980
Please enjoy, My Lord.

204
00:10:58,030 --> 00:10:59,430
It's only been a few days,

205
00:10:59,510 --> 00:11:02,790
and you've suddenly become so cultured.

206
00:11:04,790 --> 00:11:07,360
Well, your sudden visit

207
00:11:07,910 --> 00:11:11,000
couldn't be just to
whisk a bowl of tea for me.

208
00:11:11,870 --> 00:11:13,330
You're mistaken, My Lord.

209
00:11:13,870 --> 00:11:15,870
In just a few days since you got back,

210
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:18,870
you've made Yan Rui
move out of the Xie Residence

211
00:11:18,870 --> 00:11:20,670
and drop the grain swap investigation.

212
00:11:20,670 --> 00:11:23,180
What absolute genius

213
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,730
and incredible foresight.

214
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:27,910
This bowl isn't just tea.

215
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:30,030
It is a show of my

216
00:11:30,030 --> 00:11:32,270
admiration and respect for you.

217
00:11:33,750 --> 00:11:35,670
Elegance cannot be learned.

218
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:42,270
Do you know this tea has another name

219
00:11:43,030 --> 00:11:44,720
called Jicheng?

220
00:11:47,630 --> 00:11:49,000
"Ji" as in "urgent,"

221
00:11:49,870 --> 00:11:51,440
and "cheng" as in "journey."

222
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,670
It means

223
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,440
this tea is very urgent.

224
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:01,160
Since the tea leaves leave the tea tree,

225
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,720
every extra moment of delay

226
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:06,270
reduces its freshness.

227
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:10,000
So, while you appear to be
elegantly whisking the tea

228
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:12,320
at your own pace,

229
00:12:14,150 --> 00:12:16,240
you are, in fact, ruining it.

230
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,440
You seem to be

231
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,200
implying something.

232
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,160
I'm dull-witted.

233
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:31,080
Please speak plainly.

234
00:12:32,030 --> 00:12:32,960
I wouldn't dare.

235
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,600
I just think

236
00:12:34,910 --> 00:12:36,600
things are

237
00:12:37,150 --> 00:12:38,150
in reverse.

238
00:12:38,630 --> 00:12:40,510
All thanks to your care,

239
00:12:40,870 --> 00:12:44,390
my son survived this disaster.

240
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:47,150
I should be the one toasting you

241
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:49,120
with this bowl of tea.

242
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,030
My dear lord,

243
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:58,510
everything I've done was

244
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:02,280
purely for the agenda
of the person who pulls the strings.

245
00:13:02,670 --> 00:13:04,200
Second Young Master aside,

246
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:07,150
you and I are like fish in this water.

247
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,840
If one fish suffers,

248
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:11,000
the whole school perishes.

249
00:13:23,750 --> 00:13:26,210
It's not enough that
you ruined the good tea.

250
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,960
Now you're harming my fish.

251
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:33,400
Let's get down to business.

252
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,100
The grain swap matter,

253
00:13:36,670 --> 00:13:38,000
I've settled it for you.

254
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:46,480
But Yan Rui is too unpredictable

255
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,070
[Ledger]
[1st Month of the 8th Year of Jingxi]

256
00:13:45,090 --> 00:13:46,630
[Ledger] [20 grain-transport boats;
3,000 dan collected]

257
00:13:46,480 --> 00:13:47,670
a person.

258
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:49,910
If he stirs up trouble again,

259
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:52,380
you'd better hold onto your sedan chair.

260
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,870
I can't help with everything.

261
00:13:55,710 --> 00:13:56,040
[7 water ships borrowed from the Xies,
not officially registered]

262
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,600
Have you forgotten?

263
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:03,480
Who granted me this sedan chair,

264
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,390
and who is carrying it for me?

265
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:13,670
Ultimately,

266
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:17,510
Yan Rui is still after fame and fortune.

267
00:14:17,910 --> 00:14:19,840
He wants to use disaster relief
as an excuse

268
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:20,910
to earn political merit

269
00:14:20,910 --> 00:14:22,310
and then make a windfall.

270
00:14:22,910 --> 00:14:23,960
In that case,

271
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:26,320
we should play along

272
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:28,140
and help him secure the grain.

273
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:31,340
Once the money and grain are in our hands,

274
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:33,960
we can eliminate him
without getting

275
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,080
our hands dirty.

276
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:40,120
Then we'll submit a petition
to His Majesty against him,

277
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:41,660
pushing all the blame

278
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,360
onto him alone.

279
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,630
By then,

280
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:48,960
My Lord,

281
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,480
you and I will

282
00:14:51,150 --> 00:14:52,390
both be worry-free.

283
00:14:54,510 --> 00:14:56,150
Where'd we get so much grain?

284
00:14:58,550 --> 00:15:00,000
Looks like

285
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:04,360
we'll have to put on a good show.

286
00:15:14,790 --> 00:15:15,600
Yum!

287
00:15:16,630 --> 00:15:17,560
It's delicious.

288
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,720
This plum blossom pastry

289
00:15:19,910 --> 00:15:22,570
not only nourishes the skin
and enhances beauty

290
00:15:22,670 --> 00:15:25,070
but also really smells like plum blossoms.

291
00:15:25,670 --> 00:15:28,790
This four-herb lotus seed cake
is also quite exquisite.

292
00:15:28,790 --> 00:15:30,390
Its subtle, pleasant sweetness perfectly

293
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:31,910
complements its therapeutic benefits of

294
00:15:31,910 --> 00:15:33,600
soothing the mind,
strengthening the spleen,

295
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,600
and dispelling body dampness.

296
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,480
Have a taste.

297
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:36,440
Sure.

298
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,320
I hope our herbal snacks

299
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,720
will be crowd-pleasers,

300
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:41,910
so our efforts won't be in vain.

301
00:15:42,670 --> 00:15:44,080
Don't worry, Qingyuan.

302
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:45,750
Such tasty snacks will

303
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:47,170
definitely sell well.

304
00:15:49,870 --> 00:15:50,960
They're so good.

305
00:15:51,360 --> 00:15:53,160
Good thing we're opening a shop.

306
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:54,170
Otherwise,

307
00:15:54,390 --> 00:15:56,440
I'd polish off everything.

308
00:16:00,550 --> 00:16:02,010
-Have some more.
-My Lady.

309
00:16:02,030 --> 00:16:03,440
A guest outside

310
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,840
wants to see you.

311
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:21,870
Army Inspector of the Northern Frontier,

312
00:16:21,870 --> 00:16:23,440
I, the fourth daughter
of the Hengtang Xie family,

313
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:24,870
pay my respects to Your Lordship.

314
00:16:24,870 --> 00:16:27,150
So you are the Fourth Lady,

315
00:16:27,150 --> 00:16:28,320
Xie Qingyuan.

316
00:16:29,750 --> 00:16:31,440
Since you know my name,

317
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:33,700
you must be no stranger to the Xie family.

318
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:36,360
Grandmother gave us this shop

319
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,480
to practice with.

320
00:16:37,670 --> 00:16:39,080
I stayed a bit late today.

321
00:16:39,390 --> 00:16:40,480
Since we're fated to meet,

322
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,320
why don't you

323
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:43,030
come in and try our snacks?

324
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:46,200
My son insists on marrying you.

325
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,790
So I came

326
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:50,080
specially to see

327
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:52,840
what kind of woman you are.

328
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:57,480
You're easy on the eyes,

329
00:16:57,840 --> 00:17:01,120
but not particularly special.

330
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,000
I'm curious.

331
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:06,640
You're a lady of noble birth,

332
00:17:07,510 --> 00:17:09,880
yet you show your face in the streets

333
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,349
and engage in petty commerce.

334
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:14,069
What kind of spell

335
00:17:14,550 --> 00:17:16,960
did you put on my son?

336
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:19,589
My Lord,

337
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,579
if you're visiting our snack shop

338
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:24,200
for tea and snacks,

339
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,920
please deign to step out of your sedan

340
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:27,109
and come in to taste them.

341
00:17:27,109 --> 00:17:28,590
We will host you well.

342
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:31,350
If you're only here to act superior

343
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,680
and heap scorn and insult on me,

344
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,070
then I'm sorry,

345
00:17:35,350 --> 00:17:36,400
but our measly shop

346
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,600
is too insignificant

347
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:39,920
to host a distinguished guest like you.

348
00:17:41,350 --> 00:17:43,000
Sharp-tongued

349
00:17:44,510 --> 00:17:46,160
philistine.

350
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:48,910
A marriage between you and my son

351
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,760
is absolutely blasphemous.

352
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,370
Let's head home.

353
00:17:55,590 --> 00:17:56,650
Take care, My Lord.

354
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:10,550
Qingyuan,

355
00:18:11,510 --> 00:18:13,310
that was the Marquis of Danyang.

356
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:15,270
He wields massive military power

357
00:18:15,270 --> 00:18:16,830
and has a twisted personality.

358
00:18:16,830 --> 00:18:18,090
Why'd you provoke him?

359
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:21,370
I can't worry about that right now.

360
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:22,960
I need you to do me a favor.

361
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:28,680
Let's eat.

362
00:18:33,350 --> 00:18:34,200
Congxin.

363
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,350
Congxin!

364
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:43,510
Alright. Come on.

365
00:18:43,830 --> 00:18:45,550
There are tons of great ladies around.

366
00:18:45,550 --> 00:18:47,350
Why fixate on one woman?

367
00:18:47,590 --> 00:18:49,030
Isn't Qingru a catch too?

368
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:53,680
And you.

369
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:55,790
How could you be so mean

370
00:18:56,110 --> 00:18:57,680
to the woman our son likes?

371
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:58,720
My Lady—

372
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:01,050
Your fuse is getting shorter and shorter.

373
00:19:01,350 --> 00:19:02,000
My Lady!

374
00:19:02,830 --> 00:19:04,000
When you came begging my family

375
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:06,000
for my hand in marriage
when you were younger,

376
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,530
weren't you just like this?

377
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:09,960
Is it really that difficult to

378
00:19:10,110 --> 00:19:11,910
put yourself in our boy's shoes?

379
00:19:12,070 --> 00:19:14,000
-My Lady.
-Be more understanding.

380
00:19:19,590 --> 00:19:20,750
No matter what,

381
00:19:21,270 --> 00:19:22,440
that woman cannot

382
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:24,960
cross the threshold of our household.

383
00:19:28,070 --> 00:19:29,000
I'm done eating.

384
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:35,750
I'm full too.

385
00:19:36,310 --> 00:19:38,370
You father and son are unbelievable!

386
00:19:38,590 --> 00:19:40,310
One is more stubborn than the other!

387
00:19:40,310 --> 00:19:41,440
I'm done eating too!

388
00:19:42,110 --> 00:19:43,110
Who needs a family

389
00:19:43,790 --> 00:19:44,790
like this anyway!

390
00:19:46,550 --> 00:19:47,310
My Lord.

391
00:19:47,510 --> 00:19:48,160
Young Master.

392
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:48,590
Madam.

393
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:50,590
Miss Qingyuan had someone

394
00:19:50,590 --> 00:19:52,190
bring a box of herbal snacks.

395
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:03,790
How exquisite.

396
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:05,480
She's so thoughtful.

397
00:20:13,160 --> 00:20:14,090
It's delicious.

398
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:16,400
My Lord,

399
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,340
they're really well made.

400
00:20:18,830 --> 00:20:19,750
Count me out.

401
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:21,750
Come here.

402
00:20:28,830 --> 00:20:30,000
Come on. Try it.

403
00:20:32,070 --> 00:20:32,600
It's hot.

404
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:34,920
Delicious, right?

405
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,240
Mm, yes. Delicious.

406
00:20:38,550 --> 00:20:39,400
I knew

407
00:20:40,030 --> 00:20:41,830
you must still be thinking of me.

408
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,070
How about

409
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:45,960
the two of you

410
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:48,120
meet each other halfway?

411
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:50,680
My Lady,

412
00:20:50,750 --> 00:20:52,070
I'm fine.

413
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,070
That's better.

414
00:20:58,640 --> 00:20:59,480
Don't just look at it.

415
00:20:59,480 --> 00:21:00,350
Eat up.

416
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:02,090
It's delicious.

417
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:03,920
By the way, Madam,

418
00:21:04,030 --> 00:21:05,360
Miss Qingyuan also said

419
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:07,990
these snacks are an apology
to the marquis.

420
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:09,590
What a sweet girl.

421
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:27,800
Grandmother.

422
00:21:29,790 --> 00:21:31,070
Let me have a taste.

423
00:21:34,830 --> 00:21:35,750
Mother.

424
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:41,110
So pretty.

425
00:21:47,070 --> 00:21:48,070
Really good.

426
00:21:52,030 --> 00:21:53,000
Delicious.

427
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:55,180
Sweet but not cloying,

428
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,310
soft and tasty,

429
00:21:56,750 --> 00:21:58,410
and even good for your health.

430
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:01,400
Qingyuan's shop will

431
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,590
surely be a success.

432
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:08,200
Opening this shop

433
00:22:08,550 --> 00:22:09,790
is a good thing,

434
00:22:10,510 --> 00:22:13,750
but Qingyuan is not yet married.

435
00:22:14,030 --> 00:22:15,920
Doing everything herself

436
00:22:16,070 --> 00:22:17,270
must be exhausting.

437
00:22:17,830 --> 00:22:19,760
Constantly being in the public eye

438
00:22:20,790 --> 00:22:22,590
will inevitably invite gossip.

439
00:22:29,350 --> 00:22:32,270
Why not get someone in the residence

440
00:22:32,270 --> 00:22:33,510
to manage it for you

441
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:34,920
and share your burden?

442
00:22:44,310 --> 00:22:46,710
It wasn't easy for Qingyuan
to get this shop

443
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:48,370
up and running.

444
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:50,790
Of course it wasn't easy.

445
00:22:53,640 --> 00:22:56,370
Regardless, it's still
inappropriate for a lady

446
00:22:56,750 --> 00:22:58,240
to always show her face

447
00:22:58,790 --> 00:22:59,790
in public.

448
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:03,960
What is more crucial for a lady

449
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:07,270
than a blessed and smooth marriage?

450
00:23:16,790 --> 00:23:17,830
Alright.

451
00:23:18,350 --> 00:23:19,440
The girl is grown up

452
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:21,680
and has her own ideas.

453
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:26,240
Let her do what she wants to do.

454
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:31,210
It's not as if
a lady from the Xie family...

455
00:23:32,790 --> 00:23:34,920
would ever struggle to find a husband.

456
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:41,750
Mother,

457
00:23:42,110 --> 00:23:44,110
you're spoiling Qingyuan too much.

458
00:23:44,750 --> 00:23:47,680
I actually think our household

459
00:23:48,070 --> 00:23:50,550
is doing much better than before.

460
00:23:51,400 --> 00:23:52,730
In terms of management,

461
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:57,400
you should learn from Mei Yinghua.

462
00:24:08,070 --> 00:24:09,920
You're right, Mother.

463
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:12,270
I have a lot to learn.

464
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:15,190
I'll look to seek advice
from Concubine Mei.

465
00:24:20,110 --> 00:24:21,160
But Mother,

466
00:24:22,350 --> 00:24:24,030
because of Zhengjun's matter,

467
00:24:24,030 --> 00:24:25,630
the Xie family was besieged,

468
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:27,070
causing quite a stir outside.

469
00:24:27,070 --> 00:24:29,000
Although the incident has passed,

470
00:24:29,030 --> 00:24:29,920
I can't help...

471
00:24:31,440 --> 00:24:33,200
but feel sorry for Eldest Lady.

472
00:24:35,590 --> 00:24:37,000
Not one person from

473
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:40,540
the Founding Count's household
has shown up since.

474
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:42,350
It wouldn't look good

475
00:24:43,310 --> 00:24:45,550
if word got out that she is

476
00:24:46,240 --> 00:24:47,370
working in the shop.

477
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:52,680
The Founding Count's household
values Eldest Sister.

478
00:24:52,680 --> 00:24:53,960
Preparing for

479
00:24:54,350 --> 00:24:55,880
a perfect wedding

480
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:57,510
naturally takes time.

481
00:25:02,270 --> 00:25:04,670
Fret not about my little shop,
First Madam.

482
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:06,830
You're busy as it is,

483
00:25:07,030 --> 00:25:09,090
what with all the household affairs.

484
00:25:10,270 --> 00:25:11,000
Sure.

485
00:25:11,790 --> 00:25:13,850
As long as you know what you're doing.

486
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:16,270
I trust that you will

487
00:25:16,270 --> 00:25:17,670
evaluate the priorities

488
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:19,180
and make mindful choices.

489
00:25:21,440 --> 00:25:23,100
Your shop is a small matter...

490
00:25:25,920 --> 00:25:27,850
but your eldest sister's marriage

491
00:25:28,200 --> 00:25:29,510
is a big deal.

492
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:38,310
Enough talk.

493
00:25:39,590 --> 00:25:43,510
Let's all taste what Qingyuan made.

494
00:25:47,110 --> 00:25:48,070
Qingyuan,

495
00:25:50,510 --> 00:25:52,040
since you've decided on it,

496
00:25:52,880 --> 00:25:54,240
commit and do it well.

497
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,000
I understand.

498
00:26:12,550 --> 00:26:14,480
Dear locals and distinguished guests,

499
00:26:12,960 --> 00:26:14,480
[Yunji Snacks]

500
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:16,510
our Yunji Snacks

501
00:26:16,510 --> 00:26:18,350
is officially open!

502
00:26:19,640 --> 00:26:21,350
Our original snacks are

503
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,640
uniquely handcrafted

504
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:25,400
by combining
traditional Chinese herbal formulas

505
00:26:23,610 --> 00:26:26,500
[Cherokee Rosehip & Jade Dew Ball]
[Coix Seed & Poria Cake]

506
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:26,960
with various culinary techniques.

507
00:26:26,960 --> 00:26:29,180
With 36 distinct herbal snacks,

508
00:26:29,400 --> 00:26:31,660
there's surely something for everyone.

509
00:26:31,790 --> 00:26:32,400
Next,

510
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:35,350
please follow me into the shop
to make your pick.

511
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:37,020
So many kinds!

512
00:26:43,270 --> 00:26:45,270
I didn't expect our herbal snacks

513
00:26:45,270 --> 00:26:46,510
to be so popular.

514
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:51,110
It's a pity that we're both unmarried

515
00:26:51,550 --> 00:26:53,880
and have to miss out on the fun.

516
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:56,830
What kind of pointless rule is that?

517
00:26:56,830 --> 00:26:57,880
If you want to go,

518
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:59,070
I'll go with you.

519
00:27:05,790 --> 00:27:07,070
Madam Pei has arrived!

520
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:22,110
Contrary to Concubine Lian's worries

521
00:27:22,350 --> 00:27:24,480
that Madam Pei would
waver about your marriage

522
00:27:24,480 --> 00:27:26,000
because Xie Residence was besieged,

523
00:27:26,000 --> 00:27:28,000
Madam Pei has come here in person.

524
00:27:28,590 --> 00:27:30,320
But why are you hiding instead?

525
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:33,110
I'm not ready yet.

526
00:27:33,750 --> 00:27:34,920
Are you afraid that Madam Pei

527
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:36,920
is here to break off the engagement?

528
00:27:38,550 --> 00:27:40,130
I doubt that's the case.

529
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:41,790
To break off the engagement,

530
00:27:41,790 --> 00:27:43,240
a letter would be enough.

531
00:27:43,790 --> 00:27:45,790
Madam Pei coming here in person

532
00:27:46,110 --> 00:27:48,910
means that things have
taken a turn for the better.

533
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:54,790
Don't be scared.

534
00:27:55,110 --> 00:27:56,040
I'll go with you.

535
00:27:58,640 --> 00:28:00,880
How ingenious of
the women of the Xie family

536
00:28:00,880 --> 00:28:02,940
to come up with such a brilliant idea.

537
00:28:02,960 --> 00:28:03,790
Madam Pei.

538
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:09,930
Let's go.

539
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:13,890
The business is booming, huh?

540
00:28:14,030 --> 00:28:15,640
I almost couldn't spot you.

541
00:28:16,110 --> 00:28:17,370
Greetings, Madam Pei.

542
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:19,550
Madam Pei,

543
00:28:20,070 --> 00:28:21,310
long time no see.

544
00:28:22,790 --> 00:28:23,590
Come,

545
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:25,330
let me have a look at you.

546
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:28,280
My wonderful daughter-in-law.

547
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:30,920
It's been a while, and you've

548
00:28:30,920 --> 00:28:32,520
become even more beautiful.

549
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:35,400
Come,

550
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:36,440
shop with me.

551
00:28:36,440 --> 00:28:37,770
Let's pick some snacks.

552
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:41,880
We're going to be family soon.

553
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:43,510
Don't be so formal around me.

554
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:46,220
Got it, Madam Pei.

555
00:28:46,270 --> 00:28:47,070
You know what?

556
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:50,730
Your business sure is booming.

557
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:53,270
Why are you here?

558
00:28:53,590 --> 00:28:54,960
It's your opening day.

559
00:28:54,960 --> 00:28:57,020
How could I not come and show support?

560
00:28:58,160 --> 00:28:59,240
Is my tiny shop

561
00:28:59,240 --> 00:29:01,240
befitting of your attention?

562
00:29:01,590 --> 00:29:03,110
With your financial power,

563
00:29:03,110 --> 00:29:05,040
you could buy out my shop in a flash.

564
00:29:08,160 --> 00:29:10,590
You're getting sweeter and sweeter
with your words.

565
00:29:10,590 --> 00:29:12,640
I wonder if Young Master Li knows.

566
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:17,240
If you want to ask about the progress

567
00:29:17,240 --> 00:29:18,500
of the task you gave me,

568
00:29:18,830 --> 00:29:20,030
just get to the point.

569
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:21,830
Why beat around the bush?

570
00:29:21,830 --> 00:29:22,440
I see.

571
00:29:22,960 --> 00:29:24,350
Judging from your reaction,

572
00:29:24,350 --> 00:29:26,810
I take it the task
hasn't been completed yet.

573
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:27,440
What,

574
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:29,830
are you going to make me

575
00:29:30,160 --> 00:29:32,760
wait until you and Young Master Li
have a child?

576
00:29:35,750 --> 00:29:36,550
Qingyuan!

577
00:29:38,790 --> 00:29:39,510
Qingyuan.

578
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:40,480
Qingyuan!

579
00:29:45,110 --> 00:29:45,710
Qingyuan.

580
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,410
Young Master Li.

581
00:29:50,830 --> 00:29:52,480
Chunzhi heard that you opened today.

582
00:29:52,480 --> 00:29:53,740
He insisted on coming,

583
00:29:53,790 --> 00:29:56,310
saying that not even the end of times
could stop him.

584
00:29:56,310 --> 00:29:56,960
Qingyuan,

585
00:29:57,790 --> 00:29:59,200
I'm here to deliver an invitation.

586
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:02,130
My parents would like to
invite you to watch an opera.

587
00:30:04,190 --> 00:30:05,830
[From the Marquis of Danyang family]

588
00:30:06,480 --> 00:30:07,310
The marquis?

589
00:30:08,640 --> 00:30:10,640
The marquis rarely sees outsiders.

590
00:30:11,030 --> 00:30:13,560
Today he's actually
inviting you to an opera.

591
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:17,880
Do I hear some wedding bells ringing?

592
00:30:19,960 --> 00:30:21,890
Lord Yan, a lot of free time lately?

593
00:30:22,160 --> 00:30:23,290
You are everywhere.

594
00:30:23,550 --> 00:30:24,270
Of course.

595
00:30:24,510 --> 00:30:25,480
Good thing I'm here,

596
00:30:25,480 --> 00:30:27,270
or I'd have missed out on
this joyous event.

597
00:30:27,270 --> 00:30:28,480
You aren't invited to the opera.

598
00:30:28,480 --> 00:30:29,540
That's not joyous.

599
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:30,750
However,

600
00:30:31,160 --> 00:30:33,090
when Fourth Lady and I get married,

601
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:35,550
I can invite you for a drink

602
00:30:35,550 --> 00:30:37,680
and share some of my good luck with you.

603
00:30:38,640 --> 00:30:39,960
Is the banquet already booked?

604
00:30:39,960 --> 00:30:41,020
Why aren't I aware?

605
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:44,520
Fourth Lady, are you aware of it?

606
00:30:47,920 --> 00:30:50,270
Lord Yan, you don't have to
worry about this.

607
00:30:50,270 --> 00:30:52,110
Fourth Lady's heart and my heart are

608
00:30:52,110 --> 00:30:53,170
perfectly in tune.

609
00:30:59,240 --> 00:31:00,640
Marriage is a major event

610
00:31:00,790 --> 00:31:02,250
decided by one's parents.

611
00:31:02,440 --> 00:31:04,640
Please stop putting my sister on the spot.

612
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:05,200
Yes,

613
00:31:06,070 --> 00:31:07,200
that's right.

614
00:31:07,550 --> 00:31:09,160
It's not up to me anyway.

615
00:31:09,550 --> 00:31:10,950
Please, Your Lordships,

616
00:31:12,110 --> 00:31:13,550
enough teasing me.

617
00:31:13,790 --> 00:31:15,510
It's Yunji Snacks' opening day.

618
00:31:15,510 --> 00:31:16,920
Pick whatever

619
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:18,010
you want.

620
00:31:18,110 --> 00:31:20,590
It's on me. How does that sound?

621
00:31:21,510 --> 00:31:22,200
Qingyuan,

622
00:31:22,750 --> 00:31:25,640
can you recommend some snacks for me?

623
00:31:33,160 --> 00:31:33,820
Have a seat.

624
00:31:34,750 --> 00:31:35,410
This is

625
00:31:35,510 --> 00:31:37,350
our notoginseng sticky rice cake.

626
00:31:37,350 --> 00:31:39,720
Notoginseng stops bleeding
and disperses blood stasis.

627
00:31:39,720 --> 00:31:42,720
Sticky rice flushes out toxins
and reduces swelling.

628
00:31:56,940 --> 00:32:03,780
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

629
00:32:03,810 --> 00:32:11,000
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

630
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:06,510
Eldest Brother, you're upright,

631
00:32:06,510 --> 00:32:09,240
and Second Brother
did nothing wrong to get hurt.

632
00:32:09,310 --> 00:32:11,640
Since we're like-minded,
it only makes sense

633
00:32:11,100 --> 00:32:14,620
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

634
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:13,920
to get closer.

635
00:32:14,650 --> 00:32:17,820
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

636
00:32:15,270 --> 00:32:16,470
Thank you, Qingyuan.

637
00:32:17,840 --> 00:32:24,980
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

638
00:32:19,350 --> 00:32:20,000
Chunzhi,

639
00:32:20,550 --> 00:32:21,110
let's go.

640
00:32:21,550 --> 00:32:22,880
We've bought the snacks

641
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:24,070
and delivered the invitation.

642
00:32:24,070 --> 00:32:25,720
We shouldn't keep Mr. Lanshan waiting.

643
00:32:25,050 --> 00:32:32,420
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

644
00:32:26,790 --> 00:32:27,480
Qingyuan,

645
00:32:28,030 --> 00:32:29,690
see you at the southern opera.

646
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:39,450
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

647
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:43,510
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

648
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:40,510
As you saw,

649
00:32:40,920 --> 00:32:43,510
I've gotten the invitation
from Marquis of Danyang.

650
00:32:43,510 --> 00:32:44,880
Which means I've completed

651
00:32:43,530 --> 00:32:44,940
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

652
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:46,660
half of what you asked me to do.

653
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:48,030
Yes,

654
00:32:48,920 --> 00:32:51,160
the task I entrusted to you is half done.

655
00:32:52,350 --> 00:32:54,070
But isn't your blessed big day

656
00:32:54,070 --> 00:32:55,310
halfway here as well?

657
00:32:56,070 --> 00:32:57,350
I'm blessed to be able

658
00:32:57,830 --> 00:32:59,400
to share your burden.

659
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:03,370
The silly look on your face

660
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:06,380
really resembles a harmless little rabbit.

661
00:33:07,480 --> 00:33:08,440
Unfortunately,

662
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:10,640
someone is about to
bark up the wrong tree.

663
00:33:10,640 --> 00:33:12,680
What do you mean by that?

664
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:14,960
I thought

665
00:33:15,350 --> 00:33:17,350
you were just good at taming horses.

666
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:20,320
To think you're also
good at taming people.

667
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:22,600
Even the most capable heroes
couldn't get an audience

668
00:33:22,600 --> 00:33:23,600
with the marquis,

669
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:25,550
yet you received an invitation

670
00:33:25,550 --> 00:33:26,880
in just a few days.

671
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:30,570
Don't you think the marquis's son
deserves huge credit?

672
00:33:32,270 --> 00:33:33,240
Strange.

673
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:36,440
Why do you smell

674
00:33:37,240 --> 00:33:39,160
so sour today?

675
00:33:39,640 --> 00:33:40,790
Did someone

676
00:33:41,270 --> 00:33:42,800
spill vinegar all over you?

677
00:33:50,960 --> 00:33:52,070
I'm just happy.

678
00:33:53,350 --> 00:33:54,720
I'm happy that I, the fox,

679
00:33:54,720 --> 00:33:56,520
didn't capture a little rabbit,

680
00:33:56,640 --> 00:33:59,640
but a veritable immortal
with profound cultivation.

681
00:34:03,110 --> 00:34:04,590
It was just a joke.

682
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:06,590
The way you reacted,

683
00:34:07,070 --> 00:34:09,230
you might just have
let your true feelings slip.

684
00:34:09,230 --> 00:34:10,400
Since I'm a weapon

685
00:34:10,670 --> 00:34:12,760
who is valuable to you,

686
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:16,150
shouldn't you take good care of me?

687
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:18,480
Otherwise, it'll be a pity.

688
00:34:30,820 --> 00:34:37,719
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

689
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:33,290
Then you should be careful.

690
00:34:34,280 --> 00:34:36,139
Don't show your true form so soon.

691
00:34:37,739 --> 00:34:44,219
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

692
00:34:44,320 --> 00:34:51,960
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

693
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:47,679
What's wrong?

694
00:34:49,510 --> 00:34:50,370
Are you scared?

695
00:34:52,080 --> 00:34:59,380
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

696
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:58,000
As for what you asked,

697
00:34:58,400 --> 00:34:59,360
I'll get it done

698
00:34:59,520 --> 00:35:06,450
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

699
00:34:59,590 --> 00:35:00,710
within 3 days.

700
00:35:01,110 --> 00:35:03,110
Speaking of which, have you fulfilled

701
00:35:03,110 --> 00:35:04,070
my request?

702
00:35:05,070 --> 00:35:06,000
Where is Cui'er?

703
00:35:06,550 --> 00:35:16,360
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

704
00:35:07,760 --> 00:35:09,290
In your big shop, I wonder if

705
00:35:09,960 --> 00:35:12,070
you have my favorite perilla candy.

706
00:35:16,890 --> 00:35:24,090
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

707
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:21,030
You can have

708
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:22,900
whatever you like.

709
00:35:24,110 --> 00:35:31,280
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

710
00:35:26,960 --> 00:35:29,220
Hopefully it isn't poisonous this time.

711
00:35:29,840 --> 00:35:30,320
My Lord,

712
00:35:31,310 --> 00:35:34,890
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

713
00:35:31,710 --> 00:35:33,310
have you found Cui'er or not?

714
00:35:34,910 --> 00:35:38,530
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

715
00:35:35,000 --> 00:35:35,710
Alright.

716
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:38,190
When you fulfill your end of the promise,

717
00:35:38,190 --> 00:35:40,030
I'll take you
to the person you want to see.

718
00:35:38,560 --> 00:35:44,670
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

719
00:35:41,070 --> 00:35:41,600
Goodbye.

720
00:35:44,670 --> 00:35:45,330
Delicious.

721
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:50,670
Slow down on the snacks.

722
00:35:51,440 --> 00:35:54,440
Do you really think that girl
cares about your recovery?

723
00:35:54,440 --> 00:35:55,110
Mother,

724
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:57,110
this is quite tasty.

725
00:35:57,590 --> 00:35:58,960
The main thing is that after eating it,

726
00:35:58,960 --> 00:36:00,560
my butt doesn't hurt as much.

727
00:36:03,570 --> 00:36:05,720
[Notoginseng Sticky Rice Cake]

728
00:36:09,440 --> 00:36:12,030
This is an opportunity.

729
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:13,420
What opportunity?

730
00:36:14,630 --> 00:36:15,550
I could

731
00:36:15,960 --> 00:36:17,800
do First Madam a favor

732
00:36:18,280 --> 00:36:21,080
and have someone
look into Qingyuan's snack shop.

733
00:36:21,230 --> 00:36:22,360
I just don't believe

734
00:36:22,630 --> 00:36:24,280
that you can

735
00:36:24,840 --> 00:36:27,440
polish a turd.

736
00:36:35,110 --> 00:36:36,000
Old Madam.

737
00:36:36,880 --> 00:36:39,920
The Marquis of Danyang household
had a bit of a slip-up.

738
00:36:39,920 --> 00:36:42,150
The invitation meant for our family

739
00:36:42,590 --> 00:36:44,250
wasn't sent to our residence.

740
00:36:44,550 --> 00:36:46,630
Instead, it ended up in Qingyuan's hands.

741
00:36:46,630 --> 00:36:47,590
Fortunately,

742
00:36:47,710 --> 00:36:48,880
the nanny found out early,

743
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:50,920
so I could get to the bottom of it.

744
00:36:51,150 --> 00:36:52,890
[From the Marquis of Danyang family,
respectfully presented to the Xie family]

745
00:36:57,710 --> 00:36:59,550
Marquis of Danyang's family

746
00:37:00,440 --> 00:37:02,000
never hosts guests.

747
00:37:04,230 --> 00:37:08,510
I don't know whether to celebrate or worry

748
00:37:09,230 --> 00:37:13,150
about this sudden invitation.

749
00:37:14,330 --> 00:37:15,490
[From the Marquis of Danyang family,
respectfully presented to the Xie family]

750
00:37:14,550 --> 00:37:15,480
Mother,

751
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:18,840
the Marchioness of Danyang is the host,

752
00:37:19,440 --> 00:37:20,920
and their son will be present.

753
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:22,440
They invited our family's children

754
00:37:22,440 --> 00:37:23,640
and the young ladies.

755
00:37:24,230 --> 00:37:27,400
The opera must be an excuse
to discuss marriage.

756
00:37:27,880 --> 00:37:29,540
It's a cause for celebration.

757
00:37:32,030 --> 00:37:33,670
At my age,

758
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:35,440
do I need you

759
00:37:36,670 --> 00:37:38,710
to remind me about such things?

760
00:37:39,840 --> 00:37:40,510
Right.

761
00:37:43,030 --> 00:37:44,000
Qingyuan,

762
00:37:44,630 --> 00:37:45,920
tell me the truth.

763
00:37:47,150 --> 00:37:49,030
Do you have feelings for

764
00:37:49,550 --> 00:37:50,760
the marquis's son?

765
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:57,110
Mother,

766
00:37:57,670 --> 00:38:00,760
I didn't grow up in a noble family,

767
00:38:01,110 --> 00:38:03,440
but I do know the importance of gratitude.

768
00:38:03,480 --> 00:38:05,960
I'm taken care of by you in this home.

769
00:38:06,230 --> 00:38:07,320
As your daughter,

770
00:38:07,320 --> 00:38:09,320
of course I want what's best for you.

771
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:11,320
Therefore,

772
00:38:12,510 --> 00:38:14,280
I won't touch the man

773
00:38:14,630 --> 00:38:17,070
Second Sister is in love with.

774
00:38:17,440 --> 00:38:18,710
That is one reason.

775
00:38:19,230 --> 00:38:20,480
The second being...

776
00:38:24,800 --> 00:38:27,150
that I have someone else I love.

777
00:38:27,710 --> 00:38:29,000
So how could I

778
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:31,670
have any feelings for the marquis's son?

779
00:38:32,480 --> 00:38:33,280
Child,

780
00:38:34,230 --> 00:38:37,760
who is the person you love?

781
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:38,630
What's there

782
00:38:39,630 --> 00:38:40,830
to be confused about?

783
00:38:41,400 --> 00:38:43,030
Who else could it be?

784
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:46,630
Qingyuan,

785
00:38:47,800 --> 00:38:48,880
do you really have

786
00:38:49,760 --> 00:38:52,800
zero feelings for the marquis's son?

787
00:38:58,280 --> 00:38:59,440
If so,

788
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:02,150
you don't have to go to

789
00:39:02,510 --> 00:39:04,110
tomorrow's southern opera.

790
00:39:04,630 --> 00:39:05,670
Stay at home.

791
00:39:06,190 --> 00:39:08,510
You can help me massage my legs.

792
00:39:09,070 --> 00:39:12,880
Yes, Old Madam hasn't been feeling well.

793
00:39:13,070 --> 00:39:14,400
It'd be great if you stay

794
00:39:14,710 --> 00:39:16,670
and nurse her back to health.

795
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:19,550
Yes,

796
00:39:20,190 --> 00:39:24,190
I'm willing to stay home
and serve you, Grandmother.

797
00:39:25,550 --> 00:39:26,400
Is that so?

798
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:27,800
Then it's settled.

799
00:39:33,070 --> 00:39:36,190
Yan Rui is nothing
but a short-lived nuisance

800
00:39:37,480 --> 00:39:39,880
who won't last long.

801
00:39:40,710 --> 00:39:44,000
He's even made an enemy
of our Xie family.

802
00:39:44,400 --> 00:39:47,510
Are you really willing to give up

803
00:39:48,480 --> 00:39:50,150
the marquis's son for him?

804
00:39:52,760 --> 00:39:53,510
I...

805
00:39:56,070 --> 00:39:56,880
I...

806
00:39:58,360 --> 00:40:01,150
Even if the marquis's son is fond of me,

807
00:40:03,150 --> 00:40:05,750
how could I dare to
compete with Second Sister?

808
00:40:10,510 --> 00:40:11,800
The mascot

809
00:40:12,920 --> 00:40:14,650
and the blood-written poem...

810
00:40:16,360 --> 00:40:18,760
were that girl's scheme?

811
00:40:19,760 --> 00:40:21,710
You haven't been with our family

812
00:40:22,230 --> 00:40:23,880
for long,

813
00:40:24,550 --> 00:40:27,030
and I haven't had the chance to

814
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:29,000
pass any wisdom down to you.

815
00:40:29,710 --> 00:40:32,590
Today, allow me to tell you

816
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:34,670
about your father.

817
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:37,150
Twenty years ago,

818
00:40:38,480 --> 00:40:39,480
Shu was

819
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:42,800
just a petty official.

820
00:40:43,070 --> 00:40:44,670
He got to where he is today

821
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:49,550
not by keeping the peace

822
00:40:49,550 --> 00:40:51,150
and always yielding,

823
00:40:52,000 --> 00:40:52,880
but by

824
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:55,460
fighting his way through a situation

825
00:40:56,030 --> 00:40:58,630
with wolves at the front
and tigers at the back.

826
00:40:58,880 --> 00:41:00,740
He fought with tigers and snakes.

827
00:41:01,110 --> 00:41:03,070
He snatched food from wolves.

828
00:41:04,280 --> 00:41:08,150
He climbed the political ladder
the hard way,

829
00:41:08,590 --> 00:41:09,880
navigating a bloody

830
00:41:11,320 --> 00:41:12,720
and brutal competition.

831
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:28,500
Sailing against the current,

832
00:41:29,400 --> 00:41:31,330
you fall back if you don't advance.

833
00:41:31,550 --> 00:41:33,750
Now that you're a part of the Xie family,

834
00:41:33,800 --> 00:41:38,260
you should know that we're different
from those centuries-old noble families.

835
00:41:38,280 --> 00:41:42,190
Our family fought hard
to get where we are today.

836
00:41:42,550 --> 00:41:43,760
The only way to

837
00:41:43,760 --> 00:41:45,320
eliminate disrespect

838
00:41:46,230 --> 00:41:47,400
is to fight back.
